5
00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:25.620
The ink is two inches.

6
00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.650
How many inches is the fish?

7
00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:34.329
The fish is three inches.

8
00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:39.840
How many inches is the milk?

9
00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:43.934
The milk is four inches.

10
00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.360
How many inches is the dish?

11
00:00:49.451 --> 00:00:53.057
The dish is five inches.

12
00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:57.110
How many inches is the kitten?

13
00:00:58.337 --> 00:01:01.994
The kitten is six inches.

14
00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:06.000
How many inches is the pig?

15
00:01:07.028 --> 00:01:09.459
The pig is seven inches.

16
00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:14.790
How many inches is the ship?

17
00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:21.870
The ship is big! It is much longer than me!

18
